# Files that exist on the Shopify store but not in this repository.
#
# Work was done directly in the Shopify admin after this branch was last
# pushed — the product page was refactored into snippets, and the Klarna and
# finder-bar work landed there. Those files were never committed here, and
# this session had no way to fetch them (the Shopify connection was lost
# before they could be pulled).
#
# Two consequences, both enforced by scripts/lint-shopify.py:
#
#   1. A `{% render %}` of one of these is not a broken reference. The linter
#      reports it as a warning naming this file, not an error.
#   2. Nothing here may be uploaded from this repository. There is no local
#      copy to upload — writing one would replace the real file with whatever
#      stale or invented version this repo happens to hold.
#
# Delete a line once the real file has been pulled from the store and
# committed, and the linter goes back to enforcing it normally.

snippets/pl-pdp-gallery.liquid
snippets/pl-pdp-options.liquid
snippets/pl-pdp-footnotes.liquid
snippets/pl-pdp-variants-json.liquid
snippets/pl-pdp-jsonld.liquid
snippets/pl-delivery.liquid
assets/pl-pdp-plus.css
assets/pl-pdp-plus.js
assets/pl-finder-bar.css
assets/pl-finder-bar.js
sections/pl-finder-bar.liquid

# templates/product.json is also store-owned. The copy in this repo is the
# older branch version — it still sets show_cutoff, cutoff_hour and
# cutoff_text, which the store's buy block no longer declares. Merge the
# design settings onto the store's copy before uploading, exactly as was done
# for templates/index.json; never upload this one as it stands.
templates/product.json
